sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as agent
    participant AP as approval-im
    participant CH as channel
    participant U as The owner

    A->>AP: ask (about to delete 32 files, high risk)
    AP->>CH: about to delete 32 files (all .tmp), confirm?
    CH->>U: sent
    Note over AP: starts a 5-minute timer
    alt the owner replies 'confirm'
        U->>CH: confirm
        CH->>AP: matched a pending request
        AP-->>A: true
        A->>A: executes
        A->>U: deleted, moved to the trash, recoverable for a week
    else the owner replies anything else / timeout
        AP-->>A: false
        A->>U: you said not to, so I didn't
    end
    Note over AP: timeout = denial<br/>never wait forever (M0 really did hang once)
